# Copy to `.env` (never commit `.env`). Lines starting with # are optional; `FOO=` (empty) means "unset".

# ── Database (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local development with `npm run db:local` (embedded PostgreSQL, port 5433) or `docker compose up -d`:
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5433/lao_lottery?schema=public"
# Production: use a dedicated role with a strong password, e.g.
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://lao_app:<strong-password>@db.internal:5432/lao_lottery?schema=public&sslmode=require"

# ── Data refresh endpoint (POST /api/ingest) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave unset to DISABLE the endpoint. If set it must be a long random string (>= 16 chars), e.g.
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# INGEST_TOKEN=

# ── Data sources (see DATA-SOURCE.md) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source definitions live in config/sources.json. Secrets (API keys) are referenced by env-var NAME there
# (apiKey.env) and set here:
# MY_JSON_API_KEY=
# SOURCES_CONFIG_PATH=config/sources.json
# Comma-separated source ids to enable (overrides "enabled" in the config file):
# SOURCES_ENABLED=thelotterytoday

# ── Ingestion politeness / limits ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INGEST_USER_AGENT="LaoLotteryStatsBot/0.1 (+https://your-site.example/about; contact@your-site.example)"
# INGEST_REQUEST_DELAY_MS=1500
# INGEST_TIMEOUT_MS=15000
# INGEST_MAX_RETRIES=2
# INGEST_MAX_BODY_BYTES=5000000

# ── API rate limits (per client IP; in-memory, per process) ────────────────────────────────────
# RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=120
# RATE_LIMIT_HEAVY_PER_MINUTE=12
# RATE_LIMIT_INGEST_PER_HOUR=6

# ── Logging ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LOG_LEVEL=info   # debug | info | warn | error | silent

# ── Local dev database helper (scripts/db-local.ts) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCAL_PG_PORT=5433
# LOCAL_PG_DIR=.data/pg
# LOCAL_PG_DB=lao_lottery
